## Context
Source: yawn/molt sweep 2026-11-09 at d980e16. The vendored tickets/erg (sha256 4776df5d…, committed in e1f2b80) differs from the harness pin in ~/.agents/scripts/erg-pin (rev 4f2326e, sha256 89952604…); the erg on PATH matches the pin. A stale vendored binary can report false violations on tickets using newer format. A sweep must not import a binary, so the refresh travels by its own merge request.

